---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping & Delivery Policy — Hariram Namkeen"
  description="Shipping timelines, delivery information, and logistics details for Hariram Namkeen orders across India."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-inner">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">
        <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        Back to Home
      </a>

      <header class="policy-header">
        <div class="sec-tag"><span>✦</span> POLICIES &amp; DELIVERY</div>
        <h1>Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
        <p class="policy-meta">Last Updated: March 2026 · Hariram Namkeen, Muzaffarnagar</p>
      </header>

      <article class="policy-body">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Fresh Batch Preparation &amp; Dispatch</h2>
          <p>
            At Hariram Namkeen, our namkeen is handcrafted in traditional heavy iron kadhais with pure yellow mustard oil and zero palm oil or preservatives. To ensure maximum freshness and crispiness, orders are prepared fresh and dispatched from our Muzaffarnagar kitchen within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong> of order confirmation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Estimated Delivery Timelines Across India</h2>
          <p>
            We ship to serviceable PIN codes across all Indian states and Union Territories using express logistics partners. Once dispatched, typical delivery windows are:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Delhi NCR &amp; Western Uttar Pradesh:</strong> 2 – 3 business days</li>
            <li><strong>Metro Cities (Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Pune, Ahmedabad):</strong> 3 – 5 business days</li>
            <li><strong>Tier 2 &amp; Tier 3 Cities / Rest of India:</strong> 4 – 7 business days</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="note">
            <em>Please note: Deliveries may take marginally longer during national holidays, festive peak seasons, or adverse weather conditions.</em>
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Shipping Charges</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>The Special 4 Box (800g):</strong> Enjoy <strong>Free All-India Delivery</strong> with no hidden shipping fees or packaging surcharges.</li>
            <li><strong>Individual SKUs / Custom Orders:</strong> Standard nominal shipping charges apply based on parcel weight and destination, calculated transparently prior to order confirmation.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Tracking &amp; Courier Partners</h2>
          <p>
            We partner with reliable logistics providers including Delhivery, Blue Dart, DTDC, and India Post Speed Post. As soon as your order is dispatched, a direct tracking link and consignment number will be sent to your WhatsApp number and/or email address so you can track your box in real time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Packaging</h2>
          <p>
            Every order is packed with care so it reaches your doorstep in good condition.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Contact Our Dispatch Desk</h2>
          <p>
            If you need an address modification prior to dispatch or have questions about a shipment in transit, please contact us immediately:
          </p>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <p><strong>Hariram Namkeen Dispatch Desk</strong></p>
            <p>Main Market, Muzaffarnagar, Uttar Pradesh - 251001, India</p>
            <p>Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/916396122920">+91 63961 22920</a></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:namaste@hariramnamkeen.com">namaste@hariramnamkeen.com</a></p>
            <p>Operating Hours: Monday – Saturday, 9:00 AM – 8:00 PM IST</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.policy-page {
  padding: 130px 0 100px;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.policy-inner {
  max-width: 820px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 var(--gutter);
}

.back-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--maroon);
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  transition: transform .2s, color .2s;
}

.back-link:hover {
  transform: translateX(-4px);
  color: var(--maroon-l);
}

.policy-header {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(194, 127, 21, 0.2);
  padding-bottom: 24px;
}

.policy-header h1 {
  font-family: var(--F);
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 12px 0 8px;
}

.policy-meta {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.policy-body section {
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.policy-body h2 {
  font-family: var(--F);
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--maroon);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.policy-body p {
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.policy-body strong {
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.policy-body ul {
  list-style: disc;
  padding-left: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.policy-body li {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.policy-body .note {
  background: rgba(226, 158, 40, 0.08);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
  padding: 12px 16px;
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.contact-card {
  background: rgba(79, 14, 14, 0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(79, 14, 14, 0.12);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.contact-card p {
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  font-size: 14.5px;
}

.contact-card a {
  color: var(--maroon);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: underline;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .policy-page {
    padding: 100px 0 60px;
  }
}
</style>
